{"name": "Airship", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Airship is an open platform for playing multiplayer indie games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BedWars 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BedWars 2 is currently in early testing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why did we make BedWars 2 on Airship?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free kits (no 70%+ tax)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Much more advanced anticheat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Better networking to improve combat responsiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modern game engine for more powerful creator tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Better servers (with region control!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A clean slate for a fresh BedWars experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"356\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381730/extras/454aac5a553487cc196a9129032fcfcd.avif?t=1764878911\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"840\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381730/extras/6b39fdb278dd0d1175b6b00146757727.avif?t=1764878911\" width=\"1600\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become a Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We make multiplayer easy with Unity Engine and TypeScript. The Client &amp; API is even open source! Check out our website for details on how to create a game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381730/extras_big/29bf22a6c6ed308c68424b01747c99e8.webp?t=1764878911\" height=\"983\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass